      </div>

      <!-- ============ 分区：诊断 ============ -->
      <div class="view" id="view-diag" style="display:none;flex-direction:column;flex:1;min-height:0;" data-page-node-id="PfqyOPcfOgA04AMbCQtVgf">
        <div class="page-head" data-page-node-id="Wj3g9YsdCgKUPLdjkDSZUB">
          <div data-page-node-id="93H0932XgpzwYp46NC1xGK">
            <div class="page-title" data-page-node-id="BqfAE5NeXuXppgO1jAprV3">诊断</div>
            <div class="page-sub" data-page-node-id="km2hEmGmid1w5cIWHBycEQ">注入通道、选择器健康与运行环境自检</div>
          </div>
          <div class="page-actions" data-page-node-id="kDP3gP3hiRObTqfzN4aQHZ">
            <button class="btn" onclick="probeSelectors()" data-page-node-id="QvnpLbtnPO0hYgVfxxnFZL">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" data-page-node-id="0AeApfiGJ9m3hXQZOuuV39"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6" data-page-node-id="t88K7EL0YPUWwPR2InhBn7"/><path d="M20 20l-4.5-4.5" data-page-node-id="GjcdmMJy61xYxHqxVrkVbZ"/></svg>
              实测选择器
            </button>
            <button class="btn btn-solid" onclick="cdpApply()" data-page-node-id="4077lVYz2GfRaVrpko7Ppk">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-page-node-id="K39UGRlGGazbB6O65mubij"><path d="M12 3v10M8 7l4-4 4 4" data-page-node-id="pdGOpINFABYBTm0Jf7mG6B"/><path d="M5 15v4h14v-4" data-page-node-id="wka7evn8sH9DNgivkFPTBQ"/></svg>
              立即注入（CDP）
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" id="drift-card" style="margin:0 16px 12px">
          <div class="card-title">界面结构漂移检测 <span id="drift-state" class="sec-note"></span></div>
          <div id="drift-body" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7">尚未检测（需 DSH 以调试模式运行）</div>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:10px">
            <button class="btn" onclick="loadDrift(true)">重新检测</button>
            <button class="btn" onclick="rebuildBaseline()">把当前版本重建为基线</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card" id="mode-chain-card" style="margin:0 16px 12px">
          <div class="card-title">模式解析链 <span class="sec-note">启动模式切换后，detect/doctor 按此链路输出</span></div>
          <div id="mode-chain-body" style="font-size:12px;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.8;word-break:break-all">加载中…</div>
        </div>
        <div class="content" style="gap:12px;align-items:flex-start" data-page-node-id="BJI05KCjMlnBvjVPt8NdOP">
          <div class="card" style="flex:1;min-width:0" data-page-node-id="mcfj3zXXLmsyCqrGnCkXm0">
            <div class="card-title" data-page-node-id="nDwCsqjoMY1hmXgyxFGOaR">选择器健康</div>
            <div class="region-list" id="selector-list" data-page-node-id="uTXVumfLH6SuwB9VHRDg8C"><div class="region-row" data-page-node-id="6ZW6y8KxG0dYftNtsvxz3v"><span data-page-node-id="k4vERD7TTXdkrEEiIq5Kxq">加载中…</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="width:340px;flex:0 0 340px" data-page-node-id="U2QEZama5jLAdg1St1ZitY">
            <div class="card-title" data-page-node-id="3SP4qRJgMrPnFeLsQ2tNTU">运行环境</div>
